{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a strange island ruled by the enigmatic Lord Ambermaze. He has frozen time, turning the island into a trap where no one ages or dies, and bizarre creatures roam \u2014 twisted results of his magical experiments. Don\u2019t be surprised if you encounter carnivorous plums, exploding pumpkins, or mutant wasps along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5aa009c14cfa13ae53b399684063548b.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5aa009c14cfa13ae53b399684063548b.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5aa009c14cfa13ae53b399684063548b.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Great Garden Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire island is one sprawling maze teeming with odd and dangerous creatures: stink-spiders, acidic slimes, fire moths, chomping hives \u2014 and that\u2019s just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not defenseless. Armed with a magical sword, a sturdy bow, a reliable shield, and most importantly \u2014 courage \u2014 your hero is ready to outwit and defeat every threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5f5ef8f689933ede73f8f10501c358a9.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5f5ef8f689933ede73f8f10501c358a9.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5f5ef8f689933ede73f8f10501c358a9.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also need agility and sharp wits. Beyond the toothy and spiky monsters, the island is filled with traps and obstacles: bottomless pits, thorny bushes, spike traps, and more. You\u2019ll have to use your brain to get past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing and Other Activities </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the boldest adventurer needs a break. Luckily, Lord Ambermaze is packed with mini-games and side activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/c041e8c836fe245c62cffcd6cce4213e.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/c041e8c836fe245c62cffcd6cce4213e.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck at shell games and hunt for treasure (just hope you pick the right chest \u2014 or risk singed eyebrows). Go fishing and you might catch a golden fish\u2026 or a golden coin\u2026 or a bomb. Depends on your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/bf1e38d302bc26b50f75713c71ca434e.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/bf1e38d302bc26b50f75713c71ca434e.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/bf1e38d302bc26b50f75713c71ca434e.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move ancient boulders in classic sokoban puzzles and try not to throw out your back. Solve color-matching puzzles, sliding tile challenges, and escape from rooms as dark as the belly of a mutant plum. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/d8a464be19c3f7c3607b7276ad4be7b7.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/d8a464be19c3f7c3607b7276ad4be7b7.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/d8a464be19c3f7c3607b7276ad4be7b7.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Friends and Island Mysteries<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s more than just enemies on the island \u2014 you can find friends too. Meet charming ladies, each with her own backstory and personality. Give gifts and build a relationship with one (or all!) of them. After all, every hero deserves a loyal companion, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/e786c55ac2b505093694f511513940f4.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/e786c55ac2b505093694f511513940f4.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/e786c55ac2b505093694f511513940f4.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it\u2019s not just the ladies \u2014 the island is full of eccentric characters with stories to tell. Who is the stone golem and how did he end up like that? Why does the fisherman have so many clones, and what are they all trying to catch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Lord Ambermaze and uncover every secret the island hides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning of the Adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/1f58cf9ff6a474203e0bfff5826128d949ef0313.jpg"},{"name":"Through the Thicket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/0c1c9da504f024d69865357441ac4d56d2a00ce7.jpg"},{"name":"The Fire Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/6a69b74561622bc8a6fc80efcdbd1c38c52bb814.jpg"},{"name":"Face to Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/68d28b5c700901ad015676b1a9ade20f8a866aec.jpg"},{"name":"That'll do!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/7bd233efc3340677f7f6ee5a6be3942fcc0c5588.jpg"},{"name":"The Hero\u2019s Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/808aebf905772d72ff7e2d4e93d2b43f3912b264.jpg"},{"name":"Paradox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/848dc64f16f12169dbde8625fdd78e26d2274a31.jpg"},{"name":"What if it works out!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/030a470cdd76f3b8739f0f4b2a7086bbf5960b45.jpg"},{"name":"Material girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/6ec7ceb18920540d59bdbbaf3471807de983df07.jpg"},{"name":"Brave Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1811330/3cb7f3814629a1ed9a5945cbe1ea17e3c516c86c.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1811330?t=1768391833","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768391833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/28267d41f0db98ea0c5316363fd2cc75501af8d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768391833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/28267d41f0db98ea0c5316363fd2cc75501af8d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768391833","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a strange island ruled by the enigmatic Lord Ambermaze. He has frozen time, turning the island into a trap where no one ages or dies, and bizarre creatures roam \u2014 twisted results of his magical experiments. Don\u2019t be surprised if you encounter carnivorous plums, exploding pumpkins, or mutant wasps along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5aa009c14cfa13ae53b399684063548b.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5aa009c14cfa13ae53b399684063548b.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5aa009c14cfa13ae53b399684063548b.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Great Garden Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire island is one sprawling maze teeming with odd and dangerous creatures: stink-spiders, acidic slimes, fire moths, chomping hives \u2014 and that\u2019s just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not defenseless. Armed with a magical sword, a sturdy bow, a reliable shield, and most importantly \u2014 courage \u2014 your hero is ready to outwit and defeat every threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5f5ef8f689933ede73f8f10501c358a9.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5f5ef8f689933ede73f8f10501c358a9.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/5f5ef8f689933ede73f8f10501c358a9.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also need agility and sharp wits. Beyond the toothy and spiky monsters, the island is filled with traps and obstacles: bottomless pits, thorny bushes, spike traps, and more. You\u2019ll have to use your brain to get past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing and Other Activities </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the boldest adventurer needs a break. Luckily, Lord Ambermaze is packed with mini-games and side activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/c041e8c836fe245c62cffcd6cce4213e.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/c041e8c836fe245c62cffcd6cce4213e.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck at shell games and hunt for treasure (just hope you pick the right chest \u2014 or risk singed eyebrows). Go fishing and you might catch a golden fish\u2026 or a golden coin\u2026 or a bomb. Depends on your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/bf1e38d302bc26b50f75713c71ca434e.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/bf1e38d302bc26b50f75713c71ca434e.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/bf1e38d302bc26b50f75713c71ca434e.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move ancient boulders in classic sokoban puzzles and try not to throw out your back. Solve color-matching puzzles, sliding tile challenges, and escape from rooms as dark as the belly of a mutant plum. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/d8a464be19c3f7c3607b7276ad4be7b7.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/d8a464be19c3f7c3607b7276ad4be7b7.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/d8a464be19c3f7c3607b7276ad4be7b7.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Friends and Island Mysteries<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s more than just enemies on the island \u2014 you can find friends too. Meet charming ladies, each with her own backstory and personality. Give gifts and build a relationship with one (or all!) of them. After all, every hero deserves a loyal companion, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/e786c55ac2b505093694f511513940f4.poster.avif?t=1768391833\" width=1600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/e786c55ac2b505093694f511513940f4.webm?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811330/extras/e786c55ac2b505093694f511513940f4.mp4?t=1768391833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it\u2019s not just the ladies \u2014 the island is full of eccentric characters with stories to tell. Who is the stone golem and how did he end up like that? Why does the fisherman have so many clones, and what are they all trying to catch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Lord Ambermaze and uncover every secret the island hides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Potata Company"],"d